# 5. The real secret weapon: the projection DAG

This is probably the single most important infrastructure abstraction.

Don't have miscellaneous scripts such as:

```text
build_graph.py
build_essay.py
build_questions.py
```

that independently decide what to rebuild.

Represent the transformations.

```text
SOURCE
  │
  └──extract──► PASSAGE
                  │
                  ├──translate──► TRANSLATION
                  │                  │
                  │                  └──audit──► TRANSLATION_PROOF
                  │
                  └──reconstruct──► PROPOSITION
                                       │
                                       └──infer──► ARGUMENT
                                                     │
                         ┌───────────────────────────┼─────────┐
                         ▼                           ▼         ▼
                     SYNTHESIS                    CRUX      REVIEW
                         │
                         ▼
                       ESSAY
                         │
                         ├──► HTML
                         ├──► agent bundle
                         └──► EDUCATION
```

Every projection records:

```text
input hashes
transformation version
configuration version
output hash
```

`SPEC-00` already identifies exactly this projection-DAG pattern.

Then:

```text
hash(inputs + transformation + config)
```

is essentially your cache key.

If it hasn't changed:

```text
DO NOTHING
```

