And:

```text
/api/v1/argument/ARG019?view=compact
```

Maybe:

```json
{
  "id": "ARG019",
  "status": "reviewed",
  "conclusion": "PROP442",
  "premises": ["PROP81", "PROP102"],
  "defeaters": ["DEF8"],
  "cruxes": ["CRUX3"],
  "evidence": ["P:IPVV:1.5.11"],
  "authority": {...},
  "revision": 7
}
```

No decorative prose.

